{"id":2677,"bodyHtml":"<DIV><div><p>为进一步加强校企联动，拓宽毕业生就业渠道，推动产教深度融合，2026年4月14日至16日，经济与管理学院院长赵公民，教师武勇杰一行赴深圳开展访企拓岗专项调研行动。</p><p>赵公民院长一行先后走访了东莞瀚邦为光电科技有限公司、峰凯（广东）塑胶工业有限公司、中国-上海合作组织经贸交流中心粤港澳发展委员会深圳办事处、深圳市微达安计算机有限公司以及深圳市佳得设备科技有限公司等五家具有行业代表性的单位。每到一处，赵院长都详细介绍学院的专业设置、人才培养特色及2026届毕业生基本情况，深入了解企业发展动态、人才需求及岗位能力要求。</p><p>走访期间，校企双方围绕实习基地共建、订单式人才培养、科研项目合作等议题进行了深入交流。多家企业对学院毕业生的专业素养和实践能力表示认可，并初步达成人才招聘与实习合作意向。</p><p>此次访企拓岗行动不仅为毕业生拓展了优质就业岗位，也为学院进一步优化人才培养方案、提升服务地方经济发展能力积累了宝贵经验。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=WL87HDoR6kMzQRMgNLbMlUbUzCiolULPnRNDMz7sLNWVLNC0gihFp2hmCIa0L1yPoSy4M1h7MN7YMzW2oz9DL8QRM7rfLmL8UlLPM4CDL4rFL7U4nR9DUm6FMzLPM87Jv2bjo4OeoDX/_I6O_dN0qIbtpYyPLRUDg4-YozUbgtA8pUMcc&oid=1280026481&tid=1046&nid=22949&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/21936D6A252F9863FC4EA234AC176635/0D3D86B7/5317A\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=WMmCHaMzLiMR7ingR9iLRl4MzUiL4NL4oRGanmC4MzlbnRL0gihFp2hmCIa0MShVUYy8LSybL4ffolMkMRU4ozL4n7nkLRlYUz-DnzlPnmfFL4-Yoz7ZMmnFnm9PLzCJv2bjo4OeoDX/_I6O_dN0qIbtpYyPLRUDg4-YozUbgtA8pUMcc&oid=1280026481&tid=1046&nid=22949&e=.png\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=WnRCHsMzGbM4nVLgNLaozT2LzQfLzrLkUmviLRUDM8rVnmv0gihFp2hmCIa0okyiUSysMkyYU4lbMRrRLzfkLRL4Ul7PL7CaMmv4LzGiU8nFnRGan7-inmMFMRLDolCJv2bjo4OeoDX/_I6O_dN0qIbtpYyPLRUDg4-YozUbgtA8pUMcc&oid=1280026481&tid=1046&nid=22949&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/85A742C5945C10B033AA10F0673105CD/D00DB5F3/4369F\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=WUl-HYMmWRolQkLgRVkU4G4nlQkUzGLYLR9DMmlDUNUPo7l0gihFp2hmCIa0L1hkL1ysn1hfMmNPMRAVMzlYLlMfM4WRM87PM8L4n7M7oRAFMRUPLNUPoRnFU4M7LN-Jv2bjo4OeoDX/_I6O_dN0qIbtpYyPLRUDg4-YozUbgtA8pUMcc&oid=1280026481&tid=1046&nid=22949&e=.png\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=WL8LHaU4M7LmCPngmG4UmCYnzLDMmvLaUl7aMlr2oRf2LRC0gihFp2hmCIa0MYyiokybLkhfLRM7M8-DMm9Ynm6VUzvaMl7ZLmLZol-DUzVFUlrfn7lsUzAFMRWkolLJv2bjo4OeoDX/_I6O_dN0qIbtpYyPLRUDg4-YozUbgtA8pUMcc&oid=1280026481&tid=1046&nid=